	(lib_symbols)
	(text_box "Strapping pins\nGPIO 0 (Boot): 10kΩ Pull-up to 3.3V.\nGPIO 45 (VDD_SPI): 10kΩ Pull-down to GND (Critical! Tells the S3 to run internal flash at 3.3V).\nGPIO 0 Button: A tactile switch to GND (for manual firmware flashing)."
